
  VA-Crystal VoIP node  —  installed from offline media, not yet a node.

  This machine has Ubuntu, Docker Engine and the node image on disk. It has
  no node yet: identity, mothership registration and the running container
  are what the installer does, and it has not been run.

    va-node-install          install and register this node, offline image

  It asks for a node name, addresses, a mothership URL and an Account
  credential. Registration needs to reach the mothership; the image does not.

    cat /etc/va-crystal-node        what this disc was
    docker exec va-voip voipappz health     once the node is up

